values ('L1-S1','L1-S1-M1','M1','Why Do We Travel?','Why do people travel?','Understand that travel helps people visit, learn, discover, and explore.','Why Stamp','L1-S1-M2','Not Started',1),('L1-S1','L1-S1-M2','M2','My First Suitcase','What should I pack?','Learn how travelers prepare luggage.','My Stamp','L1-S1-M3','Not Started',2),('L1-S1','L1-S1-M3','M3','My Travel Ticket','What is a travel ticket?','Recognize that tickets help organize a journey.','My Stamp','L1-S1-M4','Not Started',3),('L1-S1','L1-S1-M4','M4','Where Am I Going?','How do I choose a destination?','Understand that every journey has a destination.','Where Stamp','L1-S1-M5','Not Started',4),('L1-S1','L1-S1-M5','M5','Travel Documents','What papers help me travel?','Recognize basic travel documents.','Travel Stamp','L1-S1-M6','Not Started',5),('L1-S1','L1-S1-M6','M6','Travel Checklist','How do I know I am ready?','Use a simple checklist before travel.','Travel Stamp','L1-S1-M7','Not Started',6),('L1-S1','L1-S1-M7','M7','Travel Safety Rules','Why do travel rules matter?','Understand simple safety behavior before a trip.','Travel Stamp','L1-S1-M8','Not Started',7),('L1-S1','L1-S1-M8','M8','Who Helps Me Travel?','Who helps travelers?','Recognize people who support a journey.','Who Stamp','L1-S1-M9','Not Started',8),('L1-S1','L1-S1-M9','M9','How Long Is My Journey?','How long will travel take?','Understand that journeys can take different lengths of time.','How Stamp','L1-S1-M10','Not Started',9),('L1-S1','L1-S1-M10','M10','My Travel Plan','How can I plan my journey?','Put simple travel steps in order.','My Stamp','L1-S1-M11','Not Started',10),('L1-S1','L1-S1-M11','M11','Ready To Go!','How do I know I am ready to leave?','Review the main steps before leaving for the airport.','Ready Stamp','L1-S1-M12','Not Started',11),('L1-S1','L1-S1-M12','M12','Next Stop: The Airport','What happens when I reach the airport?','Prepare learners for the airport experience.','Next Stamp','L1-S2-M1','Not Started',12),('L1-S2','L1-S2-M1','M1','What Is An Airport?','What is an airport?','Recognize an airport as a place where journeys by air begin and end.','What Stamp','L1-S2-M2','Not Started',1),('L1-S2','L1-S2-M2','M2','Airport Entrance','Where do travelers enter the airport?','Recognize the airport entrance and arrival area.','Airport Stamp','L1-S2-M3','Not Started',2),('L1-S2','L1-S2-M3','M3','Check-In Area','What happens at check-in?','Understand the basic purpose of check-in.','Check Stamp','L1-S2-M4','Not Started',3),('L1-S2','L1-S2-M4','M4','Baggage Drop','Where does my suitcase go?','Recognize that checked baggage is accepted and moved separately.','Baggage Stamp','L1-S2-M5','Not Started',4),('L1-S2','L1-S2-M5','M5','Security Check','Why do we pass through security?','Understand that security checks help keep travel safe.','Security Stamp','L1-S2-M6','Not Started',5),('L1-S2','L1-S2-M6','M6','Passport Control','Why are travel documents checked?','Recognize that travel documents are checked before international travel.','Passport Stamp','L1-S2-M7','Not Started',6),('L1-S2','L1-S2-M7','M7','Departure Hall','Where do travelers wait before boarding?','Recognize the departure hall and waiting areas.','Departure Stamp','L1-S2-M8','Not Started',7),('L1-S2','L1-S2-M8','M8','Finding My Gate','How do I know where to board?','Use signs and gate information to find the right place.','Finding Stamp','L1-S2-M9','Not Started',8),('L1-S2','L1-S2-M9','M9','Airport Signs','How do airport signs help me?','Recognize common airport signs and symbols.','Airport Stamp','L1-S2-M10','Not Started',9),('L1-S2','L1-S2-M10','M10','Airport Vehicles','What vehicles work at the airport?','Recognize simple airport service vehicles.','Airport Stamp','L1-S2-M11','Not Started',10),('L1-S2','L1-S2-M11','M11','Airport Teamwork','Why do many people work together?','Understand that airports depend on teamwork.','Airport Stamp','L1-S2-M12','Not Started',11),('L1-S2','L1-S2-M12','M12','Next Stop: Boarding','What happens before I enter the aircraft?','Prepare learners for the boarding process.','Next Stamp','L1-S3-M1','Not Started',12),('L1-S3','L1-S3-M1','M1','What Is Check-In?','Why do passengers check in?','Understand that check-in confirms a passenger''s journey.','What Stamp','L1-S3-M2','Not Started',1),('L1-S3','L1-S3-M2','M2','My Boarding Pass','What is a boarding pass?','Recognize the boarding pass as an important travel document.','My Stamp','L1-S3-M3','Not Started',2),('L1-S3','L1-S3-M3','M3','Baggage Tag','Why does my suitcase get a tag?','Understand that baggage tags help bags reach the correct destination.','Baggage Stamp','L1-S3-M4','Not Started',3),('L1-S3','L1-S3-M4','M4','Airport Security Tray','Why do I use a tray at security?','Recognize basic security screening steps.','Airport Stamp','L1-S3-M5','Not Started',4),('L1-S3','L1-S3-M5','M5','Waiting At The Gate','What should I do while waiting?','Understand calm and safe behavior at the gate.','Waiting Stamp','L1-S3-M6','Not Started',5),('L1-S3','L1-S3-M6','M6','Boarding Call','How do I know when it is time to board?','Recognize boarding announcements and instructions.','Boarding Stamp','L1-S3-M7','Not Started',6),('L1-S3','L1-S3-M7','M7','Boarding Groups','Why do people board in groups?','Understand simple organization during boarding.','Boarding Stamp','L1-S3-M8','Not Started',7),('L1-S3','L1-S3-M8','M8','Walking To The Aircraft','How do passengers reach the aircraft?','Recognize different ways passengers move from gate to aircraft.','Walking Stamp','L1-S3-M9','Not Started',8),('L1-S3','L1-S3-M9','M9','Aircraft Door','Where do I enter the aircraft?','Recognize the aircraft door and boarding entrance.','Aircraft Stamp','L1-S3-M10','Not Started',9),('L1-S3','L1-S3-M10','M10','Finding My Seat','How do I find my seat?','Use seat numbers and simple signs to find a seat.','Finding Stamp','L1-S3-M11','Not Started',10),('L1-S3','L1-S3-M11','M11','Cabin Welcome','Who welcomes passengers onboard?','Recognize the cabin crew