d',10),('L1-S4','L1-S4-M11','M11','One Big Aviation Team','Why do all aviation roles need each other?','Understand that safe aviation depends on teamwork.','One Stamp','L1-S4-M12','Not Started',11),('L1-S4','L1-S4-M12','M12','Next Stop: Inside The Aircraft','What will I discover inside an aircraft?','Prepare learners to explore the aircraft interior.','Next Stamp','L1-S5-M1','Not Started',12),('L1-S5','L1-S5-M1','M1','What Is An Aircraft?','What is an aircraft?','Recognize an aircraft as a machine that can fly.','What Stamp','L1-S5-M2','Not Started',1),('L1-S5','L1-S5-M2','M2','Aircraft Nose','What is at the front of the aircraft?','Recognize the nose section of an aircraft.','Aircraft Stamp','L1-S5-M3','Not Started',2),('L1-S5','L1-S5-M3','M3','Aircraft Wings','Why does an aircraft have wings?','Recognize wings as an important part of flight.','Aircraft Stamp','L1-S5-M4','Not Started',3),('L1-S5','L1-S5-M4','M4','Aircraft Tail','What is at the back of the aircraft?','Recognize the tail section.','Aircraft Stamp','L1-S5-M5','Not Started',4),('L1-S5','L1-S5-M5','M5','Aircraft Engines','What helps an aircraft move?','Recognize aircraft engines.','Aircraft Stamp','L1-S5-M6','Not Started',5),('L1-S5','L1-S5-M6','M6','Aircraft Wheels','Why does an aircraft need wheels?','Recognize landing gear and ground movement.','Aircraft Stamp','L1-S5-M7','Not Started',6),('L1-S5','L1-S5-M7','M7','Inside The Cabin','What is the passenger cabin?','Recognize the cabin as the area where passengers sit.','Inside Stamp','L1-S5-M8','Not Started',7),('L1-S5','L1-S5-M8','M8','Inside The Cockpit','Where do pilots work?','Recognize the cockpit as the pilots'' working area.','Inside Stamp','L1-S5-M9','Not Started',8),('L1-S5','L1-S5-M9','M9','My Seat And Seat Belt','Why do I wear a seat belt?','Recognize the seat belt as an important safety item.','My Stamp','L1-S5-M10','Not Started',9),('L1-S5','L1-S5-M10','M10','Overhead Bins','Where do small bags go?','Recognize overhead storage areas.','Ove